 "description": "Library id export \u2014 stable ids for the works homed here. Batch export of library_id rows (id, title, author, year, property tags) for the works that home on peopleanalyst.com. Ids are content-addressed (SHA-256 of normalized title|authors|year) and stable across repos, so a consumer can join to this catalog without string matching. Scoped to works homed here \u2014 titles whose canonical home is another property are excluded, matching /library.",
